      "shortDescription": "See Codex task status, switch models, check usage limits, and toggle Fast from a compact desktop panel.",
      "description": [
        "Codex Micro Monitor puts Codex task status in a compact desktop panel. The first page brings status lights, the model dial and common controls together. The second page shows up to 14 tasks. See activity, input requests, questions, unread results and errors, then click to open the chat.",
